This product includes software developed at aiwcorpo (https://github.com/aiwcorpo).

mcp-platform-dev is a local development and test environment, not a product. Everything it generates (passwords,
client secrets, keys, certificates, the internal CA, the OpenBao unseal key and root token) is for local runs only.
The users alice, bob, carol and mallory, the mock systems and the stand-in services are worked examples.
Never reuse any of this material outside a development machine.

It pulls third-party container images (Keycloak, OpenBao, Redis, PostgreSQL, nginx, WireMock and others) that are not
part of this repository and keep their own licenses.
